<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued 1.8 million EKO (EARNS which Knock Out on either barrier) warrants, in six equal tranches, on the dollar/mark exchange rate, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    RANGE	  ISS PRICE  MAX PAYOUT  MATURITY</p>
<p> TRANCHE A   1.57-1.67    1.95	 10.00 DEM   22.AUG.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE B   1.55-1.72    3.05	 10.00 DEM   22.AUG.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE C   1.59-1.75    2.30	 10.00 DEM   22.AUG.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE D   1.57-1.67    2.55	 10.00 DEM   25.APR.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE E   1.55-1.72    6.02	 10.00 DEM   25.APR.97</p>
<p> TRANCHE F   1.59-1.75    3.95	 10.00 DEM   25.APR.97</p>
<p> PAYDATE	05.FEB.97	 LISTING  FFT BER HAM STG DDF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
